{% set leaders = [
  {
    name: "Iko Uwais",
    role: "Chairman",
    img: "/assets/img/about/iko-uwais.png",
    alt: "iko-uwais"
  },
  {
    name: "Yentenius Jerriel",
    role: "Executive Chairman",
    img: "/assets/img/about/iko-uwais-movies.png",
    alt: "iko-uwais-movies"
  },
  {
    name: "Ryan Santoso",
    role: "Chief Executive Officer",
    img: "/assets/img/about/iko-uwais-martial-arts.png",
    alt: "iko-uwais-martial-arts"
  },
  {
    name: "Adamy Nurdin",
    role: "Chief Operating Officer",
    img: "/assets/img/about/iko-uwais-best-movies.png",
    alt: "iko-uwais-best-movies"
  }
] %}

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pb-16 pt-20 mt-10 sm:mt-0 md:mt-20 lg:pb-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 lg:px-0">

    {# HERO TITLE + SUBTITLE #}
    <div class="relative mb-6 md:mb-[90px]">
      {# background siluet team (opsional, bisa ganti gambar sendiri) #}
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 -top-50 -z-10 lg:block">
        <img
          src="/assets/img/bg-about.png"
          alt=""
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="text-center max-w-[832px] mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[40px] lg:text-[46px] font-medium leading-tight text-white mb-8">
          Uwais Pictures Menghadirkan Aksi 
          <span class="sm:block">Global Dipimpin oleh Iko Uwais</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-[18px] max-w-[600px] mx-auto leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted">
          Tim kami menghadirkan dampak sinematik dengan keahlian perfilman yang terinspirasi dari sinema kelas dunia, Iko Uwais.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# LEADERS GRID #}
    <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 mb-14">
      {% for person in leaders %}
        <article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl bg-uwais-card-soft shadow-card p-4">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-4">
            <img
              src="{{ person.img }}"
              alt="{{ person.alt }}"
              class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[24px] md:text-[24px] font-medium text-white">
              {{ person.name }}
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[16px] md:text-[16px] text-uwais-muted">
              {{ person.role }}
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {# SECTION: OUR TALENT #}
    <div class="space-y-10">

      {# SECTION: OFFICIAL TEAM #}
      <section class="rounded-3xl bg-uwais-card-soft shadow-card px-5 py-5 md:px-5 md:py-5">
        <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] items-center">

          <div class="mb-4 lg:mb-0">
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
              <img
                src="/assets/img/about/movie-maker.png"
                alt="movie-maker"
                class="w-full max-full object-fill"
                loading="lazy"
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl leading-normal font-medium text-white mb-4">
              Tim Resmi
            </h2>
            <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted mb-16">
               Uwais Pictures adalah tim aksi resmi yang dipimpin oleh Iko Uwais, dengan keahlian dalam desain pertarungan, koreografi, dan koordinasi stunt. Berbekal pengalaman luas bersama Iko Uwais di berbagai produksi besar, baik lokal maupun internasional, tim ini berkolaborasi dengan sineas ternama dari seluruh dunia. Konsistensi dalam menghadirkan aksi kelas atas memperkuat reputasi Uwais Pictures sebagai salah satu kekuatan terdepan dalam genre aksi bersama Iko Uwais.
            </p>
            
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-3xl bg-uwais-card-soft shadow-card px-5 py-5 md:px-5 md:py-5">
        <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.1fr)_minmax(0,.9fr)] items-center">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl leading-normal font-medium text-white mb-4">
              Talenta Kami
            </h2>
            <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted mb-16">
              Talenta kami terdiri dari para profesional terampil yang mewujudkan visi aksi Uwais Team melalui keahlian dalam desain pertarungan, koreografi, dan performa stunt. Dedikasi mereka memperkuat identitas kami dalam perfilman aksi, sementara kolaborasi dengan sinema serta jaringan perfilman global membantu memperluas jangkauan internasional dan distribusi global Uwais Pictures.
            </p>

            <a
              href="https://gersh.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"
              class="inline-flex items-center text-[18px]  justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E31E26] px-7 py-2.5 text-white shadow-soft transition hover:bg-uwais-red-soft"
            >
              <span>Kunjungi Gersh</span>
              <span class="ml-2 text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">➜</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="order-first lg:order-none">
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
              <img
                src="/assets/img/about/Iko-Uwais-Movie-Maker.png"
                alt="Iko-Uwais-Movie-Maker"
                class="w-full max-full object-fill"
                loading="lazy"
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
